      "name": "Ammo Info in Actions Menu",
      "slug": "ammo-info-in-actions-menu",
      "teaser": "A very simple mod to give more information about the ammo you are looking at in-raid with things like Caliber, Penetration, and Damage.",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2757.png",
      "downloads": 3668,
      "favourites_count": 0,
      "description": "<p>The config.json file contains the following options</p>\n<p>ShowDamage - true/false - Switch to false to hide the damage line for the tooltip</p>\n<p>ShowCaliber - true/false - Switch to false to hide the caliber line for the tooltip</p>\n<p>ShowPenetration - true/false - Switch to false to hide the penetration line for the tooltip</p>\n<p>Please report any bugs or suggestions through <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/CollinHerber/SPT-AmmoInfoInActionsMenu/issues\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Github Issues</a></p>\n",
